  "body": "Found while fixing #12. A whole-part 2D Adaptive on a block with a boss: at the block's outer corner the tool centre stands 4.70 mm from the corner with R 5 - the path cuts 0.30 mm into the part - and `verify` reports no warnings. The area handed to the planner is correct (the corner is outside it); the Adaptive generator itself produces the move, and the verifier misses it.\n\nTwo defects, both P0 (silent gouge):\n1. the Adaptive path leaves its cutter-centre area at an outer corner;\n2. the verifier does not convict a 0.30 mm intrusion at that corner.\n\nPinned by the ignored test `whole_model_pocket::a_whole_part_adaptive_keeps_the_full_tool_radius_off_the_part` (crates/app/tests/whole_model_pocket.rs, lands with the #12 fix). Likely also affects picked pockets with islands - check.\n\nDone means: the Adaptive path keeps the full tool radius off the part everywhere (the test passes, un-ignored), and the verifier convicts the same intrusion on a constructed path.",
